    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "4b9289b9-3a37-46c1-8897-b503ba738d8d",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Une collaboration essentielle avec le wedding planner ou le coordinateur</strong></span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "d472a9e9-c8ee-480a-8958-336102e1ca2d",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "c76b6b17-ee00-4bbe-bb6c-419760c754c5",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Lorsque l’événement est encadré par un </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.spiceevents.fr/mariages\" data-type=\"undefined\" target=\"_self\"><u>wedding planner</u></a></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> ou un </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.spiceevents.fr/evenementiel\" data-type=\"undefined\" target=\"_self\"><u>coordinateur</u></a></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">, le DJ travaille main dans la main avec lui. En amont, ils échangent sur :</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "f7067ca9-be49-43d7-85ba-f02242ba4d17",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "b3f47f24-0855-4c41-84b9-5d97d8199094",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p2\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- le planning détaillé de la journée,</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "64cf1fb5-aef9-43d2-9a93-e26faad88334",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "153199e5-6f4f-4e55-ab5e-f05d24590feb",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- les moments clés (entrée des mariés, discours, ouverture de bal, surprises),</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "dad682f5-8978-45d6-bced-b003dbe0fd9f",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "90e32d59-cf3f-4405-aa18-44427fac1981",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- les imprévus possibles et les plans B.</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "fa250edc-40ef-4e9b-9718-6a6f3f177f97",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "38c3b91a-c2d9-4d59-967d-6763ad80fe84",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Cette collaboration garantit une </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>soirée fluide</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">, sans stress, où chaque temps fort arrive au bon moment.</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "2b8db62b-c0a6-467c-ab9c-04de2c819e7c",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "406ad82b-3b46-4da4-b85f-14dbb5f6a82b",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\"><span style=\"display: inline-block\"></span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
